    "Agents 与启动配置": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agents and launch settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 聊天应用路径、环境变量和模型；会话恢复、消息格式与权限参数由 App 管理。模型可填写 sonnet、opus、haiku 或账号可用的完整模型 ID。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude chat uses the configured executable, environment and model. The app manages session recovery, message format and permissions. Use sonnet, opus, haiku or a full model ID available to your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claude 聊天需要更新后台，请完成当前任务后重新准备工作区。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude chat requires a backend update. Finish active tasks, then prepare the workspace again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Code Pax · SSH 工作空间": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code Pax · SSH workspaces"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 原生聊天仅应用默认模型，其余启动配置用于交互终端。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex native chat uses only the default model. Other launch settings apply to interactive terminals."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 和 Claude Code 支持原生聊天与交互终端；其他工具在交互终端中运行。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
