    "会保留历史会话。如果仍有运行中或待审批的任务，服务器会拒绝重启。代理设置在新的后台进程启动时生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chat history is preserved. The server refuses to restart while tasks are running or awaiting approval. Proxy changes take effect when the new backend starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
